  "id": "psychological-autopsy",
  "term": "psychological autopsy",
  "definition": "Psychological autopsy is a method used to build an in-depth understanding of the factors that may have led to a suicide. In this context, it is used to examine the complex risks and pathways involved, especially in vulnerable groups such as adolescents.",
